."", ""outcome_quote_section"": ""discussion"", ""outcome_computation"": """", ""outcome_computational_quote"": """", ""outcome_robustness"": """", ""outcome_robustness_quote"": """", ""outcome_confident"": true, ""outcome_reasoning"": ""Verdict scoped to this cited original; no aggregate count transferred. For reference 25, the explicit NKX2-1 contrast is failed; no explicit comparison settles its FOXE1 finding.""}"
