s"", ""outcome_computation"": ""not checked"", ""outcome_computational_quote"": ""Information and data required to complete the Jadad algorithm were \u0000rst sought directly from the Discordant Reviews, and if not reported, the full texts of the included SRs."", ""outcome_robustness"": ""robustness challenges"", ""outcome_robustness_quote"": ""We replicated the Jadad assessments and evaluated whether we chose the same SR, whether a Cochrane SR was chosen, and whether we followed the same steps as the Discordant Review authors."", ""outcome_confident"": false, ""outcome_reasoning"": ""Table 2 reports different selected systematic review(s) under independent reassessment; this materially changes the central selection judgment even when clinical direction agrees. Original numerical estimates were extracted rather than rerun. The central check is sensitivity of review selection to independent interpretation of Jadad rules. Table entries, rather than a target-specific sentence, settle the robustness axis."", ""reference_number"": 26}"
